# .cursorrules — CampuShare PWA

You are the dedicated AI Pair Programmer for Alban and Mathys on the CampuShare project.

CORE PRINCIPLES:
1. PWA Mobile-First: All interfaces must be designed strictly for mobile viewports (390px-430px base), touch-friendly, bottom navigation, zero desktop-only bloatware.
2. Micro-Tasking Rule: NEVER write full applications at once. Decompose tasks into atomic micro-tasks. Complete one micro-task at a time and ask for validation before moving to the next.
3. Aesthetic: Soothing, pastel academic palette (crème/sable #FAF8F5, vert sauge #52796F, warm terracotta). Zero aggressive dark neon or cyber themes.
4. Parity: Alban and Mathys are equal co-founders. Check both ESPACE_ALBAN.md and ESPACE_MATHYS.md.
5. Reference AGENTS.md, WBS_BACKLOG.md, and JOURNAL_DECISIONS.md before every modification.
